      "value": "A similar issue can be seen in this world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ebc40dab-e142-41bc-bd64-1c82834b92b0\n\nThe water is very shaky and pixelated and also has glowing artifacts around the avatar. Tested on an RX 580.",
